# Privacy Policy

Last updated: May 2026

## Introduction

AI Blog Manager is an AI-powered content management platform currently under development.

This Privacy Policy explains how information may be collected, stored and processed when using the platform.

---

## Information We Collect

Depending on the features used, the platform may collect:

- Account information
- Email address
- Connected WordPress website information
- API credentials provided by users
- Content generated through connected AI providers
- Editorial planning information

---

## Third-Party Services

AI Blog Manager may connect to third-party services including:

- WordPress
- OpenAI
- Anthropic
- LinkedIn
- Google Analytics
- Google Search Console

Users are responsible for reviewing the privacy policies of these services.

---

## Data Storage

Credentials and configuration settings are stored securely.

Sensitive information such as API keys should never be exposed publicly.

Reasonable measures are implemented to protect stored information.

---

## Data Usage

Collected information is used solely to:

- Authenticate users
- Connect external services
- Generate content
- Publish content
- Provide analytics and reporting

AI Blog Manager does not sell personal information to third parties.

---

## Data Deletion

Users may request deletion of their account and associated data at any time.

